menu "Rive runtime"

    config RIVE_TEXT
        bool "Text (HarfBuzz + SheenBidi)"
        default y
        help
            Builds Rive's text engine with HarfBuzz (shaping) and SheenBidi
            (bidirectional text). Fonts are embedded in the .riv file; glyphs
            are drawn as ordinary paths. Adds roughly 1 MB of code.

    config RIVE_LAYOUT
        bool "Layouts (Yoga)"
        default y
        help
            Builds Rive's layout engine (Yoga flexbox). Without it, layout
            components keep their unlaid-out positions.

    config RIVE_AUDIO
        bool "Audio (miniaudio)"
        default y
        help
            Builds Rive's audio engine (miniaudio: MP3 / WAV / FLAC / Vorbis
            decoding and mixing) so audio events in a .riv play. Built as
            an external engine: no audio device inside miniaudio; the app
            pulls mixed samples (see Rive player > Audio output).

endmenu
